Subject: [PATCH 12/12] markdown: math is typeset - $..$, $$..$$, \(..\),
 \[..\] and ```latex blocks marked by the transpiler, rendered with KaTeX
 0.16.11 (MIT, in static/js/katex, loaded only when a page has math; money
 like $5 and $10 stays text); graphviz block: the DOT source no longer shows
 as a second text block, DOT / SVG copy buttons side by side with plain
 labels, SVG copies the whole picture

